@Haroenv @bobylito So I added the alias in webpack and now everything is working fine 👍
```js
resolve: {
            extensions: ['.ts', '.js'],
            alias: {
                'react': 'preact-compat',
                'react-dom': 'preact-compat'
            }
}
```
@bobylito I never had the issue with 2.0.2, and it is only ~~those two widgets~~ the one widget `MenuSelect` that the error comes up for, which I am not using by the way. [(update)](https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch.js/issues/2612#issuecomment-349061638)

Oh and @Haroenv, sorry I can't put up my code, I'm working with a private repo.
